Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.98,0:01:33.98,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,Title,0,0,0,,{\fad(836,1)\an1\pos(40,300)\fscx94}Episode 9    {\fscx100\fsp4.7}My Big Sister Has Changed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.98,0:01:35.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It's been a while, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.97,0:01:37.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:39.64,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.60,0:01:42.69,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Hey, Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.94,0:01:44.66,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.04,0:01:51.04,sign_2543_7_Menacing,Sign,0,0,0,,Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.79,0:01:48.66,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.45,0:01:56.87,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Kii!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:02:00.03,sign_2819_10_Clueless,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(135,90)\t(1,651,\fs23)\fad(1,411)}Clueless
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:01:58.52,italics,Fudo,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.02,0:02:08.77,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,K-Kii?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.77,0:02:11.11,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Kii-ii-ii!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.23,0:02:14.41,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Just someone I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.87,0:02:17.87,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,What is your name?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.87,0:02:18.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Fu—
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:20.68,sign_3334_18_Flustered,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(140,150,135,140)\fad(1,749)\frz19.59}Flustered
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.05,0:02:21.01,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,M-Mudo, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.64,0:02:23.16,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Mudo-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.42,0:02:26.85,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,What's an average Gekko foot soldier \Ndoin' in my daughter's...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.38,0:02:30.20,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,in {\i1}Reaper Princess{\i0}'s room?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.67,0:02:31.88,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:34.04,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-He was helping me study!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.04,0:02:35.67,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I have a test coming up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.67,0:02:37.92,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You great oaf!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.92,0:02:41.16,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,What's a great soldier of \NGekko need to be studyin' for?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.16,0:02:44.56,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,All ya need's a wicked heart and \Na drive toward world domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:47.68,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,And what's happenin' in this room, here?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.91,0:02:50.18,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Look at all this froo-froo crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:55.06,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You're not even puttin' up a Gekko flag!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.69,0:02:59.82,sign_9132_124_Lifetime_Soldier,Sign,0,0,0,,Lifetime Gekko Soldier
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.06,0:02:57.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey! Stop it, Dad!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.15,0:02:59.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You're ruinin' the atmosphere!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.82,0:03:01.57,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Don't you talk that way to—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.57,0:03:02.82,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Ouch!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.87,0:03:07.58,sign_4385_37_Shock,sign,0,0,0,,Shock
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.13,0:03:07.01,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,A-Are these... Super Bosslar-kun Dolls?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.58,0:03:13.33,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,The legendary dolls that I longed for so \Ndesperately when I was still in action...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.33,0:03:15.34,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Just left lyin' around...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.34,0:03:17.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,There's just nowhere to put them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:21.61,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Bosslar-sama! I beg your forgiveness!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.59,0:03:21.61,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,Sorry. This is just kind \Nof how my father is...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.61,0:03:23.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Don't worry. It's no problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.18,0:03:26.13,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,And I have to say, your father is very—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.34,0:03:26.13,top,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Oh, right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.13,0:03:27.60,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Listen up, Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.60,0:03:31.98,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I heard you turned down \Nyour monster promotion!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.98,0:03:35.97,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I spent my entire life as a \Nlow-level Gekko soldier...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.97,0:03:37.73,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I can't tell ya how proud \NI was seein' my daughter
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.86,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,rising through the ranks so quickly...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.45,0:03:45.37,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,What's goin' through your head \Nturnin' that down, you great oaf?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.98,0:03:48.62,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,If you don't mind my saying so, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.69,0:03:53.80,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san only reached that decision \Nafter long, hard consideration.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.25,0:03:57.17,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I ask that you do not chastise her for—
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.39,0:04:07.76,sign_5884_55_Smash,sign,0,0,0,,Smash
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.94,0:04:15.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,F-Mudo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.23,0:04:22.44,main,Urami,0,0,0,,What would you know about my sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.71,0:04:26.82,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Maybe you oughta stay outta \Nour business, outsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.45,0:04:29.96,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,A-Are you all right, Fudo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.96,0:04:32.47,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Well, she's definitely your little sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.47,0:04:34.33,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Full of terrifying potential.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.93,0:04:37.10,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I appreciate the sentiment, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.10,0:04:39.93,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But you really shouldn't speak \Nup about my life like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.93,0:04:41.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami is...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.86,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:42.86,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.34,0:04:49.35,italicstop,Urami,0,0,0,,I love my big sister. I love my \Nbig sister. I love my big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.49,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.11,0:04:44.49,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.98,0:04:46.00,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's just say she's got \Na serious sister complex.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:46.11,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.74,0:04:46.11,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.00,0:04:48.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I see. I'll be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.74,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.36,0:04:47.74,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.35,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.99,0:04:49.35,sign_6746_66_Love_Big_Sister,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\alphaFF\t(769,770,\alpha00)}Love {\alpha00}Big Sister
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.25,0:04:53.26,italics,Commercial,0,0,0,,Here's the best way to blast away fatigue!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.26,0:04:56.71,italics,Commercial,0,0,0,,The brand-new energy drink, Power 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.71,0:05:00.22,italics,Commercial,0,0,0,,Red Gelato recommends Power 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.22,0:05:02.72,italics,Red,0,0,0,,With just one drink, you can \Nblast away Gekko {\i1}and{\i0} exhaustion!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:05.46,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You annoyin' little brat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.46,0:05:09.58,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess is gonna tear \Nout your guts any day now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:14.91,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,What? Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.91,0:05:16.58,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Just kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.58,0:05:17.92,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Your humor is adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.80,0:05:27.80,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,We gotta get rid of Gelato 5\N as soon as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.80,0:05:31.32,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Desumi! Quit wastin' your time on studies!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.32,0:05:34.43,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Spend it trainin' from now on instead!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.43,0:05:37.80,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,In a year's time, you'll be \Nfinished with high school,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.80,0:05:40.59,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,and you'll be able to \Nfocus on Gekko full-time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.59,0:05:41.69,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You got that, Desumi?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.92,0:05:43.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.35,0:05:51.41,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,I hope we can go together, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.74,0:05:53.25,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,I know we will.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.12,0:05:57.96,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,S-Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.08,0:06:00.65,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I have a request to make of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.61,0:06:02.73,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.46,0:06:07.18,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san wishes to go to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.59,0:06:08.79,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I beg you, allow her!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.99,0:06:16.29,italics,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.61,0:06:19.60,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I thought somethin' strange \Nwas goin' on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.93,0:06:24.06,main,Urami,0,0,0,,The sister I knew wasn't \Nall carefree like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.57,0:06:28.24,main,Urami,0,0,0,,She should be the strongest \Nand most ruthless person ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.59,0:06:31.07,main,Urami,0,0,0,,And you ruined her.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.89,0:06:34.24,main,Urami,0,0,0,,My sister was invincible.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.24,0:06:35.49,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Give her back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.48,0:06:40.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stop, Urami.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.22,0:06:42.58,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:44.15,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.38,0:06:47.84,sign_9720_111_Tearful,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,208)\frz22.81\fad(734,1)}Tearful...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.94,0:06:54.43,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I hate you, Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.54,0:07:04.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Sir! I beg you, give Desumi-san \Npermission to go to university!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.07,0:07:06.37,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,This is a family matter, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.37,0:07:07.94,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You'd better stay out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:09.21,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I will not be silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:16.22,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.22,0:07:18.31,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You give me no choice!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.33,0:07:20.68,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Get up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:23.08,sign_10543_121_Menacing,Sign,0,0,0,,Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.72,0:07:23.08,sign_10543_121_Menacing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an9}Menacing
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.68,0:07:23.08,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I'll teach you a lesson in the \NGekko way of doin' things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.75,0:07:24.54,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.54,0:07:26.09,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Let us begin, Mudo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:27.61,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,W-Wait a mi—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.09,0:07:32.30,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Kii!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:41.66,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I didn't do any—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.66,0:07:43.37,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Do you see, Mudo-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.37,0:07:45.75,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,This is the art of defeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.75,0:07:47.07,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Art?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.07,0:07:49.48,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,"How spectacularly can one lose a fight?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:54.32,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I spent my years with this organization \Nworking to refine this one skill!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.06,0:07:59.34,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,But I don't think you understand \Nthe pride I take in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.34,0:08:00.44,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.78,0:08:02.93,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Mudo-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.43,0:08:04.97,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You truly understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.72,0:08:06.61,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.61,0:08:08.01,main,Mob Gekko Soldier A,0,0,0,,Gleek!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.79,0:08:09.02,sign_11672_138_Gleek,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(321,532)\t(1,1155,\fs40)}Gleek
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.48,0:08:08.48,sign_11688_140_No_Beauty,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(120,260)\fsp4}No Artistry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.63,0:08:11.02,main,Mob Gekko Soldier B,0,0,0,,Gwah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.02,0:08:11.72,sign_11725_142_Gwaaaaah_,sign,0,0,0,,{\move(165,265,110,155,1,2179)\fad(163,1)\t(1,2179,\fs20)}Gwaaaaah!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.48,0:08:11.72,sign_11688_140_No_Beauty,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(115,75)\fsp4}Artistry
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:18.47,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Others have laughed at that skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.47,0:08:22.48,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,But I always believed it was \Nworth devoting myself to.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.92,0:08:24.13,flashback,Fudo,0,0,0,,I will not be silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.51,0:08:30.61,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,I can tell that you, too, are prepared \Nto devote yourself to a single cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.49,0:08:38.33,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You seem like a young man \Nwith a lot of promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:48.15,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Desumi. I'm borrowin' your shower.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.38,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,S-Sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.93,0:08:57.26,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,We can discuss the university \Nthing another time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:10.57,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,See ya later, Desumi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.57,0:09:13.38,main,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Look after Urami tomorrow, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.79,0:09:20.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm sorry about all that, Fudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.78,0:09:23.38,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I got you mixed up in a \Ncomplicated situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.38,0:09:27.42,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Easily dealt with, if it means \Nwe can go to university together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.39,0:09:32.90,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You really are very dashing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.45,0:09:36.65,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fudo, thank you for everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.96,0:09:39.37,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.47,0:09:58.29,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,What's she lookin' like that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.66,0:10:04.27,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,I don't wanna see her lookin' like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.22,0:10:09.34,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,I'll never accept that \Nman's presence in her life!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.67,0:10:14.97,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love After World Domination!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.11,0:10:21.80,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,210)\fs40\bord3\c&HF4FEFE&\fad(840,1)}Five\NYears\N Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.20,0:10:20.65,flashback,Spikes,0,0,0,,Hey, hey! Wait up, Urami!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.65,0:10:21.80,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Urami?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.80,0:10:24.57,flashback,Baldy,0,0,0,,Look at her! Urami the Loner!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.57,0:10:27.01,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,C'mon, tell us off!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.01,0:10:28.14,flashback,Baldy,0,0,0,,Bet she can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:30.02,flashback,Baldy,0,0,0,,She's just a little emo who can't \Ntalk louder than a mumble!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.78,0:10:35.29,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,Desumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.29,0:10:37.03,flashback,Baldy,0,0,0,,Crap! Beat it, guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:45.54,sign_15372_173_Candy_Shop,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,0)}{\frz10.43\fax-0.19\pos(160,165)}Candy Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.13,0:10:45.54,sign_15372_173_Candy_Shop,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1500,0)}{\c&H7A70AD&\fax-0.19\fsp6\an2\pos(420,80)\frz13.26}Chikugo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.29,0:10:49.81,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Urami.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.81,0:10:51.97,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here. Want an ice pop?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:57.67,sign_15372_173_Candy_Shop,Sign,0,0,0,,{\c&H3A317F&\move(235,170,235,40)\an2\fs21\bord1.5}Candy Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.67,0:10:57.67,sign_15372_173_Candy_Shop,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an2\bord2\move(370,150,370,20)\3c&H7A9EDC&}Chikugo
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.33,0:11:01.51,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Get strong, Urami.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.68,0:11:05.31,flashback,Desumi,0,0,0,,Strength is what you need to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:06.87,flashback,Urami,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.70,sign_9447_74_1_Week_Earlier,Sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(530,125)\bord3\fs40}Present\N Day
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.70,0:11:26.70,sign_16369_183_To_Mt__Takao_Ent,sign,0,0,0,,To Mt. Takao Entrance
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.71,0:11:31.33,sign_16537_184_Yesterday_was_gr,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz9.56\pos(310,255)\fad(1,98)}Yesterday was great!\NI loved your room!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.46,sign_16629_185_Bring_it_on_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\frz9.56\pos(342,42)\frx32\fry4\fad(98,1)}Bring it on,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.56,0:11:35.46,sign_16629_185_Bring_it_on_,Sign,0,0,0,,{\an8\frz9.56\frx32\fry4\pos(425,285)\fad(98,1)}any time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.44,0:11:41.32,sign_16746_187_Grr,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,454)}Grr
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.97,0:11:39.69,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Grr...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.81,0:11:54.49,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What's with you? It's like ya \Nbeen in a bad mood all morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.95,0:11:57.32,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I ain't in no bad mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.74,0:11:59.69,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, you sure this's where you wanna go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.03,0:12:04.07,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I don't think it's worth sendin' Dad \Nhome early and stickin' around for.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.14,0:12:06.03,main,Urami,0,0,0,,What's the big deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.03,0:12:09.70,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I just want to check out the place \NI'm gonna start workin' next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.83,0:12:28.82,main,Combatant A,0,0,0,,Salute Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.82,0:12:31.10,main,Combatant B,0,0,0,,Welcome, Reaper Princess!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.15,0:12:33.85,main,Urami,0,0,0,,That's my big sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.85,0:12:35.85,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,When she's outside she \Nacts all weak an' casual,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.85,0:12:38.86,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,but inside the organization's walls,\N she's totally intimidatin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.61,0:12:43.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What do I always tell you?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.55,0:12:46.49,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I really don't like getting \Nthe full royal treatment...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.03,0:12:49.35,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Just say "hello there," okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.35,0:12:51.46,main,Combatant C,0,0,0,,I'm not sure we can really...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.46,0:12:52.50,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.50,0:12:56.17,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,More importantly, do I look\N any different today?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.17,0:12:57.09,main,Combatant C,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.47,0:13:01.00,main,Combatant C,0,0,0,,Oh, perhaps you seem a bit more \Nbloodthirsty than usual!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.43,0:13:03.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,C'mon, notice the new hair!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.79,0:13:05.88,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:09.99,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Is that how you always act in \Nfront of your subordinates?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.99,0:13:12.45,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I guess so, more or less...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.54,0:13:14.85,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.85,0:13:17.42,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,What's got you in such a bad mood?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:33.62,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess's little sister, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.62,0:13:37.25,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Y-Yes. I'll be out of \Njunior high next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.25,0:13:39.63,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I hope to join Gekko then!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.54,0:13:44.40,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I fear Reaper Princess has \Nset the bar very high.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.40,0:13:46.76,main,Bosslar,0,0,0,,I hope you'll work hard to vault it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.76,0:13:49.51,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Y-Yes! I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:51.80,main,Beast,0,0,0,,If you're related to Reaper Princess,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.80,0:13:53.78,main,Beast,0,0,0,,you must be pretty talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:56.52,main,Steel,0,0,0,,Gekko will be fortunate to have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.88,0:13:59.93,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,Even the rest of the Princess \Nseries respect her.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.93,0:14:01.10,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,My big sister really is—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.10,0:14:03.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami! You like popcorn?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.78,0:14:07.64,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I hear a new place just \Nopened up in Harajuku!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.64,0:14:08.38,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.38,0:14:09.64,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.64,0:14:10.28,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister—
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.28,0:14:14.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I wanna try it out before I eat \Nit with Fudo—I mean, Mudo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.05,0:14:17.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And who wants to hang around \Nthis musty old place?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:19.79,sign_5871_55_Missing,Sign,0,0,0,,{\3c&H89206A&\blur3\fs40}Speechless
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.79,0:14:22.75,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I apologize for my sister! \NI apologize for my sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.82,0:14:27.30,sign_20735_234_That_s_pretty_mu,sign,0,0,0,,{\frz5.867\pos(270,20)\fad(753,1)}That's\Npretty\Ntypical,\N actually
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.10,0:14:47.33,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here, it's frozen popcorn!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.10,0:14:49.05,main,Urami,0,0,0,,No, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.49,0:14:58.83,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It looks great on you, Urami!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.83,0:15:00.08,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Seriously, no thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.48,0:15:01.78,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'll take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.78,0:15:03.80,main,Clerk,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.99,0:15:09.34,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I wonder if he'd like this outfit!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.52,0:15:12.59,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Mudo has one of these!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.06,0:15:16.18,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,And he says this one's really convenient!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.50,0:15:18.85,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Oh, this one too!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.23,sign_22031_245_Caramellato,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.22\pos(128,205)\frz356.4\fsp.2}Caramellato
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.23,sign_22031_245_Caramellato,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.22\frz356.4\bord2\pos(203,200)\fs9}\hStrawberry\NBanana Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.23,sign_22031_245_Caramellato,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.21\pos(292,213)\frz356.6\fs8\fscx90}Chocolate Banana
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.23,sign_22031_245_Caramellato,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.22\frz356.4\bord2\fs11\pos(378,210)}\hS{\alpha4B}ilky\NBanana Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.85,0:15:21.23,sign_22031_245_Caramellato,sign,0,0,0,,{\fax-0.22\frz356.4\bord2\fs11\pos(488,215)\fsp.2}\hStrawberry\N{\fsp1.5}Almond Cream
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.93,0:15:21.56,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,We can also try some crêpes—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.56,0:15:22.28,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I'm leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.86,0:15:24.73,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,H-Hey, Urami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.73,0:15:26.77,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I mean it, what's with ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.66,0:15:34.81,main,Urami,0,0,0,,The sister I looked up to is gone now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.81,0:15:35.79,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.73,0:15:41.93,main,Urami,0,0,0,,You look like a total weakling now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:49.29,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,W-Wait, Urami!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.29,0:15:50.26,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.59,0:16:07.29,flashback italics,Baldy,0,0,0,,Found Urami the Loner!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.29,0:16:09.99,flashback,Baldy,0,0,0,,Nowhere to be, huh, emo girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.52,0:16:15.74,flashback,Baldy,0,0,0,,Whoops! Couldn't see ya with that \Nblack cloud hangin' over ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.80,0:16:18.74,flashback,Urami,0,0,0,,Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.74,0:16:21.37,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,What? You say somethin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.37,0:16:23.25,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,Couldn't hear ya!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.25,0:16:25.78,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,She can't even talk back \Nwithout her big sister around.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.78,0:16:27.59,flashback,Hat,0,0,0,,Total emo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.98,0:16:35.94,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Urami ain't left her room yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.94,0:16:39.76,flashback,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,No, an' it's been a whole week.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.76,0:16:44.45,flashback,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,She must be so sad to have \Nher sister away in Tokyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.25,0:16:56.62,flashback italics,Reporter,0,0,0,,Reaper Princess appears before \Nour Gelato 5 once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.62,0:16:59.80,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,We've been waitin' for ya, Desumi-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.80,0:17:02.01,flashback,Kids,0,0,0,,Hooray! Hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.17,0:17:03.91,flashbacktop,Kids,0,0,0,,Go, Big Sis!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.91,0:17:07.42,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Darn it, five on one ain't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.42,0:17:11.30,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,She needs backup! What're those \Noafish foot soldiers thinkin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.10,0:17:14.65,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,You hear that, Urami?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.65,0:17:16.30,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,We lost again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.54,0:17:19.93,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,But your big sister stayed \Non her feet to the end!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:23.31,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Urami! Your sister's \Nworkin' hard again today!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.69,0:17:27.31,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Urami! Your sister's gotten \Neven stronger than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.31,0:17:31.32,flashback,Desumi's father,0,0,0,,Urami! Your sister was the top \Nperformer again this month!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.41,flashback,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Isn't that somethin', Urami?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.41,0:17:37.57,flashback,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Your sister's finally \Nbeen promoted to monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.75,0:17:46.94,flashback,Desumi's mother,0,0,0,,Urami...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.47,0:17:53.72,flashback,Urami,0,0,0,,I wanna be like my big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.19,0:18:06.77,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,My big sister was the one thing \Nthat kept me goin' in life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.09,0:18:12.44,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,But she used to be so awesome... \Nand now, she's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.54,0:18:19.71,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,She met that strange man here \Nin the city, an' he ruined her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:33.40,main,Tan,0,0,0,,Hey, you cryin'?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.40,0:18:35.30,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Dumped by your man?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.30,0:18:38.55,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Come hang out with me and forget that jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.96,0:18:41.95,main,Tan,0,0,0,,Hang on, man. She seem a little young to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.95,0:18:44.30,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Who cares? She's a cutie.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.30,0:18:45.89,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,C'mon, let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.83,0:18:48.10,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Let me go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.10,0:18:50.52,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Hey, did she just mumble something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.14,0:18:54.27,main,Tan,0,0,0,,What are you, some kind of emo kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.03,0:18:59.60,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,Yeah, looks totally emo to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.60,0:19:01.91,main,Tan,0,0,0,,Bet she can't even hold \Na proper conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.59,0:19:03.80,main,Tan,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.80,0:19:04.45,main,Tan,0,0,0,,Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.45,0:19:06.42,main,Tan,0,0,0,,You hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.42,0:19:09.02,flashback italics,Baldy,0,0,0,,Nowhere to be, huh, emo girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.02,0:19:11.21,flashback italics,Hat,0,0,0,,Total emo!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.39,0:19:19.93,main,Tan,0,0,0,,Who are you supposed to be?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.66,0:19:27.03,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.34,0:19:31.82,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Don't cry, Urami.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.65,0:19:34.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Here. Want a crêpe?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:36.77,main,Urami,0,0,0,,I think... we got bigger \Nthings to worry about...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.77,0:19:38.99,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Hey, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.32,0:19:46.02,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You said you think I look weak, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.50,0:19:52.96,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,But I'm actually the strongest \NI've been in my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.08,0:19:59.88,main,Tan,0,0,0,,C'mon, don't ignore us. \NThat's how you make us mad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.88,0:20:03.35,main,Glasses,0,0,0,,We might look nice, but we're real bad guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.71,0:20:06.74,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,It seems I don't have to hold back, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.22,0:20:09.55,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.63,0:20:13.24,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,I'm the real bad guy here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.00,0:20:37.05,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Fall in love, Urami.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.30,0:20:41.70,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Love is what you need to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.47,0:20:44.94,main,Urami,0,0,0,,That ain't what you used to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.92,0:20:55.44,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,You'll understand, some day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:59.46,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Yeah, right. \NI'd rather not understand that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.93,0:21:07.72,main,Urami,0,0,0,,The crêpe is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.57,0:21:21.69,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,My big sister has changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.55,0:21:26.90,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,She's lost her edge, become soft and girly.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:31.81,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,But I guess she ain't so bad that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.06,0:21:33.96,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,But you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.38,0:21:35.64,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,You're a big problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.64,0:21:37.48,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,I'm never gonna like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.25,0:21:38.98,sign_31103_330_Desumi_san,Sign,0,0,0,,{\move(425,120,445,45)\frz328.7\t(1,1730,\fs33}Desumi-san
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.48,0:21:38.98,main,Fudo,0,0,0,,Desumi-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.45,0:21:43.55,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,Once I join Gekko, \Nyou're the first one I'll purge.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.99,0:21:45.27,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,Mwahaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.27,0:21:46.39,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,Mwahaha...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.39,0:21:48.33,italics,Urami,0,0,0,,Mwahahahaha!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.52,0:23:21.80,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.80,0:23:23.07,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.07,0:23:24.38,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.38,0:23:25.81,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.81,0:23:27.01,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.01,0:23:28.05,main,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.46,0:23:30.72,main,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami! Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.46,0:23:34.60,italicstop,Urami,0,0,0,,Next episode: "Atop the Kokutei Moon."
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.99,0:23:40.25,sign_8302_60_Episode_1__I_Lov,sign,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(40,300)\fad(1005,1)\fsp1.3}Episode 10   {\fsp.6}Atop the Kokutei Moon
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.82,0:23:37.72,italicstop,Urami,0,0,0,,Big Sister... I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.72,0:23:39.35,top,Desumi,0,0,0,,Urami!
